  "chapter": "HV_HIGH_VOLTAGE",
  "description": "Doping is the process of intentionally introducing impurities into semiconductors to alter their properties.

§7Silicon§r can be doped with small amounts of §ePhosphorus§r to make a better §eSilicon Boule§r.

